{"verse_key": "2:149", "surah": 2, "verse": 149, "text_uthmani": "وَمِنْ حَيْثُ خَرَجْتَ فَوَلِّ وَجْهَكَ شَطْرَ ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ ۖ وَإِنَّهُۥ لَلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكَ ۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ بِغَـٰفِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "So from wherever you go out [for prayer, O Muḥammad], turn your face toward al-Masjid al-Ḥarām, and indeed, it is the truth from your Lord. And Allāh is not unaware of what you do.", "verse_from_ms": 3222230, "verse_to_ms": 3238870, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/2.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَمِنْ", "start_ms": 3222230, "end_ms": 3223140}, {"i": 1, "text": "حَيْثُ", "start_ms": 3223140, "end_ms": 3223690}, {"i": 2, "text": "خَرَجْتَ", "start_ms": 3223690, "end_ms": 3224470}, {"i": 3, "text": "فَوَلِّ", "start_ms": 3224470, "end_ms": 3225250}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَجْهَكَ", "start_ms": 3225250, "end_ms": 3225960}, {"i": 5, "text": "شَطْرَ", "start_ms": 3225960, "end_ms": 3226610}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْمَسْجِدِ", "start_ms": 3226610, "end_ms": 3227520}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلْحَرَامِ", "start_ms": 3227520, "end_ms": 3228460}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 3228460, "end_ms": 3229940}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 3229940, "end_ms": 3230910}, {"i": 10, "text": "لَلْحَقُّ", "start_ms": 3230910, "end_ms": 3231200}, {"i": 11, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 3231200, "end_ms": 3232550}, {"i": 12, "text": "رَّبِّكَ", "start_ms": 3232550, "end_ms": 3232930}, {"i": 13, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 3232930, "end_ms": 3233780}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 3233780, "end_ms": 3234850}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 3234850, "end_ms": 3235930}, {"i": 16, "text": "بِغَـٰفِلٍ", "start_ms": 3235930, "end_ms": 3237125}, {"i": 17, "text": "عَمَّا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}